  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Building Resilience in the Sahel through Adaptive Social Protection</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Build the evidence and justification for adaptive social protection in the Sahel by establishing national level systems that will build the resilience of vulnerable populations and can be scaled in a time of crisis.</narrative>
